[00:11.22] Sat there never yawning
[00:12.74] Had to take all of the dawn in
[00:21.80] Woke up just to have the light
[00:23.78] Reflected from your eyes
[00:32.30] "If this isn't nice, what is?"
[00:36.44] She whispered softly to me
[00:50.40] Wrote off shaking limbs
[00:51.92] As just the cold against my skin
[00:59.48] Couldn't understand the sweat
[01:03.08] Collecting in my hands
[01:11.48] "If this isn't nice, what is?"
[01:15.82] She whispered softly to me
[01:18.92] You take your time
[01:18.92] You fill your space
[01:18.92] With amazing grace
[01:18.92] You move too quick for pictures
[01:18.92] I won't blink 'cause I might miss you
[01:18.92] You've got a halo floating round your head
[01:18.92] While mine's exploding
[01:18.92] "If this isn't nice, what is?"
[01:18.92] She whispered softly to me
[01:29.30] You take your time
[01:33.18] You fill your space
[01:39.34] With amazing grace
